              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.13.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kigana 13:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyido nitie Obed Edom, ma Were omiyo silwany ma wote aboro, cungo kwoŋ nywolirok: Semaya, Yehozabad, Yowa, Sakar, Nethanel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amiel, Isakar kodi Peulethay.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Semaya, okayo pa Obed Edom oyido nitie gi wote aucel: Othini, Rafaili, Obed, Elizabad, Elihu kodi Semakia. Oyido jobedo jodongo i nonin pajo ro nyalo pajo madwoŋ aka ario macowe oyido jonitie gi talenta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6+1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6",
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.6+1CH.26.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.6",
              "1CH.26.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikway Obed Edom kodi nyikwaye oyido joromo cwo piero aucel g'ario ma ŋeyo tic me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meselemia oyido nitie gi cwo apar g'aboro ma jonitie gi nyalo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i nono pa Merari oyido nitie Hosa; aka wote jobedo: Simiri (bamere oketho go jatel, makada nende go oyido k'obedo okayo), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hilikia, Tebalia kodi Zekaria. Kanyacel oyido nitie cwo apar g'adek jobedo jokur ma Ot pa Were wok peco pa Hosa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokur me opok jo i kitipin, cungo kwoŋ pecin pajo, aka omiy jo tic i Ot pa Were, paka Jolevi man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisi peco, mathin kosa madwoŋ obolo kwir ma ŋeyo waŋkac mene ma jolakuro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selemia otero waŋkac ma yuwok ceŋ, aka wode Zekaria, jacwo m'oyido timo tic maber, otero waŋkac ma yumalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obed Edom otero waŋkac ma yupiny, aka wote omiy jo kuro kisikin ma kan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sufim kodi Hosa jotero waŋkac ma yupodho ceŋ kodi waŋkac m'ilwoŋo ni Saleketh i royo ma malo. Oyido jokuro i weso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I waŋkac ma yuwok ceŋ, oyido bedo jokur aucel kisi ndelo, yumalo, aŋwen, yupiny, aŋwen, aka jokur aŋwen oyido jokuro kakan; ario i kisi acel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokur aŋwen oyido jokuro royo ma kadho yu diedipo, aka ario oyido jokuro diedipo won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me apaka tic ma kur opok ri nono pa Kora kodi Merari.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic man ma Ot pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwoŋ Jolevi Ahija am'oyido telo kakan pesa kodi kakan mic m'omiy Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladan, acel kwoŋ wot Gerisom oyido obedo kwari kitipin ma pecin m'oromo, kiri gi peco pa wode Yehiel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikway Ladan ario man, Zetham kodi Yowel, oyido jokuro kakan pesa ma Ot pa Were kodi kisikin ma kan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikway Amiram, Izihar, Hebron kodi Uziel bende opok jo tic.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sebuwel, janono pa Gerisom, wod pa Musa, oyido neno pesa ma Ot pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Luwo kwoŋ omin Elieza, omin Gerisom, go oyido timo wat gi Selomith. Elieza obedo ba Rehabia, m'obedo ba Jesia, ba Yoram, ba Zikiri, ba Selomith. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selomith me kodi wutmin oyido jokuro mic ma Kere Daudi omiyo Were, oyido jobedo jotel ma pecin, ma nonin, kodi jotel pa jolweny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jokwanyo gigipiny mogo m'oyido jomako i lweny aka jomiyo ma oro i Ot pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Selomith kodi peco pere oyido jokuro kisi gim'omiy ma oro i Ot pa Were, kiri gi mic ma Samwiri jatuci wac Were, Kere Saulo, Abuner wod pa Ner kodi Yowab wod pa Zeruya jokelo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic pa Jolevi man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
