          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwoŋ nyikway Hebron, Hasabia kodi wade pere 1,700 joje cwo ma jonitie gi nyalo oyido jobedo jodhum ma dini kodi ji i Isiraili yupodho ceŋ ma malawa Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeria oyido obedo jatel pa nyikway Hebron. I oro ma piero aŋwen ma dhum pa Kere Daudi, omeny peco pa Hebron kodi nyikwaye, aka onwaŋ nike cwo ma jonitie gi nyalo ma peco me oyido jobedo Yazer iy'adec ma Giliad. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.26.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.26.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 26:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kere Daudi oyero jotel ma pecin 2,700 wok kwoŋ wade pa Yeria aka oketho jo jodhum ma dini kodi ji i Isiraili yuwok ceŋ ma malawa Yordan, adec pa Ruben, Gad kodi yuwok ceŋ ma Manase.",
          "type": "text",
